        <item>
            <title>2.41.0</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 20:26:51 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>129</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.41.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Changes
- Opening another Mac's session from the sidebar is much faster on a slow connection: the transcript now travels compressed (Brotli), about 3× smaller on the wire. A 1.9 MB transcript that took ~13 s to arrive over a 150 KB/s uplink now takes ~4 s. Takes effect once the Mac *hosting* the session runs this version; older Canopy and phone clients keep receiving the uncompressed stream unchanged.
]]></description>
